{"version":1,"key":"card:559","content":{"id":559,"content":[{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装(Windows)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"前往 "},{"type":"link","url":"https://www.mysql.com/","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MySQL官网"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 进行下载，下面社区版，版本为 8.0.30。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660145809564.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660145809564.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"然后点击安装，一直点击下一步，有几个需要注意的事项："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"MySQL 使用的端口号默认为 3306"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146603749.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146603749.png"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"需要配置 root 的密码，用以连接数据库"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146730691.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146730691.png"}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"安装程序在系统中注册了一个名为 MySQL80 的服务"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146777468.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/1660146777468.png"}]}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"启动/停止服务"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种方法可以启动/停止服务。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一种办法，按下 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Win + R","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后输入 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"services.msc","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，打开服务界面，找到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"MySQL80","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，右键手动开启与停止。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/image-2022081109999.png","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/LastKnightCoder/image-for-2022@master/image-2022081109999.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二种方法，通过命令行（需要管理员权限）："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"shell","code":"# 启动 MySQL80 服务，不区分大小写\nnet start mysql80\n# 停止 MySQL80 服务\nnet stop mysql80","uuid":"2c0edfb5-f330-40ea-9bed-7c91c5e9e7e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"header","level":2,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"连接 MySQL"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先需要将 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"mysql","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 添加到 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"PATH","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 环境变量中，例如我的安装地址是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"C:\\Program Files\\MySQL\\MySQL Server 8.0\\bin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，然后通过如下命令连接 MySQL"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"shell","code":"mysql -h 主机名 -p 端口号 -u 用户名 -p 密码","uuid":"e5463413-b8e2-4b86-8cef-8721b9a3daad","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"上述命令包含四个选项："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-h","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：指定 MySQL 服务器所在的主机，不指定时默认为本机"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：指定 MySQL 服务器所在的端口号，不指定默认为 3306"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-u","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：指定用户名"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-p","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"：指定密码"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"示例写法："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","language":"shell","code":"mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -p 3306 -u root -p # 按下回车后输入密码\n# 等价于\nmysql -u root -p","uuid":"f1eab6a2-b7fe-4848-8a5d-89306f5d0cdc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["MySQL/安装"],"createTime":1744171856408,"updateTime":1763390634853,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1763390634853}}